# 23. Reference Architecture

Putting account, browser, proxy, scheduling, and worker management together:

```text
                         Account Manager
                                │
               ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐
               ▼                ▼                ▼
           Account A        Account B        Account C
               │                │                │
        ┌──────┼──────┐  ┌──────┼──────┐  ┌──────┼──────┐
        ▼      ▼      ▼  ▼      ▼      ▼  ▼      ▼      ▼
     Session Browser Network Session Browser Network Session Browser Network
        A       A       A       B       B       B       C       C       C
                        │
                        ▼
                    Task Queue
                        │
               ┌────────┼────────┐
               ▼        ▼        ▼
            Worker A Worker B Worker C
               │        │        │
               └────────┼────────┘
                        ▼
